hadiths[100]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3311","as nay ayk shrayy arb ka zkr kya jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha kh myry bywy nay ayk kalay bytay kw jnm dya hay awr myn nay as say ankar kr dya hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say pwchha kh kya aap kay pas awnt hyn، jb aap nay jwab dya kh aap kay pas hyn tw aap nay pwchha kh an ka rng kya hay awr btaya gya kh wh srkh hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh kya an myn kwyy shamy hay، awr btaya gya kh kchh hyn۔ as nay pwchha kh as kay khyal myn yh kysay hwa، awr btaya gya kh yh ayk tnao tha js ky trf wh waps aagyay thay۔ phr yh khh kr kh shayd yh kwyy tngy hay js ky trf bchh waps chla gya hay، as nay asay ankar krnay ky ajazt nhyn dy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3312","aayshh nay kha kh atbh bn abw wqas nay apnay bhayy sad kw wsyt ky۔ abw wqas nay kha kh zmah ky lwndy ka byta an ka tha، awr as say kha kh as ky dykh bhal krw۔ fth kay sal sad nay asay yh khh kr lay lya kh wh as kay bhayy ka byta hay، lykn abd allh۔ zma nay asay apna bhayy qrar dya۔ anhwn nay byk wqt khda kay rswl، sad say altja ky kh \khda kay rswl، myray bhayy nay mjhay an kay baray myn wsyt ky hay\"" awr abd bn abd allh۔ zmah nay kha، \""wh myra bhayy hay awr myray bap ky lwndy ka byta hay، as kay bstr pr pyda hwa hay۔\"" phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” abd bn zmah tmhara hay، kywnkh bchh asy ky trf mnswb hay js kay bstr pr wh pyda hwa hay، awr zany ksy hq say mhrwm hay۔” phr as nay sadh bnt zmah say kha kh wh atbh say mshabht ky wjh say as say prdh kray، yhan tk kh as nay asay khda kay samnay nh dykha۔ as nay kha: \""wh tmhara bhayy abd bn zmah hay kywnkh wh apnay bap kay bstr pr pyda hwa tha۔\"" 3 1. alhjr۔ as ka mtbadl many yh hw skta hay kh zany kw sngsar kya jayay۔ 2. yany jb tk wh fwt nh hw jayay۔ 3۔ yh wzahty azafh msabyh alsnh myn nhyn hwta۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3313","anhwn nay kha: ayk dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas tshryf layay awr frmaya kh kya mjhay yh sn kr tajb nhyn hwa kh mjz almdljl1 dakhl hwyay hyn، awr asamh awr zyd 2 kw apnay srwn pr qalyn awrhay hwyay awr paon dkhatay hwyay dykh kr frmaya: yh paon aaps myn jray hwyay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm) 1. qbylh mdlj kay afrad kay baray myn kha jata hay kh wh jsmany khswsyat say talq ka pth lganay kay qabl thay۔ 2. asamh zyd kay bytay thay۔"
"3314","sad b۔ abw wqas awr abwbkrh rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs jan bwjh kr apnay bap ka dawyٰ kray jw as ka bap nhyn hay tw as pr jnt hram hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3315","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay bapwn kay khlaf nh hw، kywnkh jw apnay bap kay khlaf kray ga wh kafr hw gya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3316","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna jb lant krnay waly aayt 1 nazl hwyy: ”jw awrt ksy aysay khandan myn shaml hw jw as say talq nh rkhty hw، wh allh say ksy rhmt ky amyd nhyn rkh skty (ya allh kay dyn pr nzr rkhnay waly nhyn hay) awr allh asay apny jnt myn dakhl nhyn kray ga، awr allh taalyٰ as shkhs say prdh dalay ga jw apnay bchay kw jhtlata hay، awr jb wh sb say phlay asay dykhta hay awr asay shrmndh krta hay۔ abwdaod، nsayy awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔ 1. alqraan 24:6"
"3317","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay ayk aadmy kay baray myn byan kya kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha kh myry ayk bywy hay jw ksy kw bhy nhyn manty jw as say hmbstry krna chahay، lykn jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay tlaq dynay ka kha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh myn as say mhbt krta hwn، as lyay aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh as swrt myn asay rkhna chahyay۔ abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay، nsayy ka khna hay kh nql krnay walwn myn say ayk nay asay abn abas rzy allh anhma say nql kya hay awr ksy nay nhyn kya، mzyd yh kh yh rwayt shyh nhyn hay۔"
"3318","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say apnay dada kay baray myn byan kya kh: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay fyslh kya kh js kw as kay wald ky wfat kay bad khandan ka frd smjha jata hay js ky trf as ky trf mnswb kya jata hay jb kh wrsaa khtay hyn kh wh an myn say hay، kh agr wh as lwndy ka bchh hay js kay wald nay as say hm bstry ky thy tw wh an lwgwn myn shaml hay jw as say phlay as kay shaml hwnay kay khwahan thay lykn an myn shaml nhyn thay۔ tqsym؛* albth as kw wrast myn say as ka hsh mlta hay jw phlay say tqsym nhyn kya gya tha، lykn agr bap js ky trf mnswb hay as say ankar kr dya hw tw wh warswn myn shaml nhyn hwga۔ agr wh ksy lwndy ka bchh hw js kay bap kay pas nh hw ya ksy aazad awrt ka js say as nay najayz hmbstry ky hw tw wh warswn myn shaml nhyn hwta awr nh hy as ka wars hwta hay khwah wh js ky trf mnswb hw wh wldyt ka dawyٰ krta hw kywnkh wh zna ka bchh hay khwah as ky man aazad hw ya lwndy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ mrqat 3:506 as bat ky wzaht krta hay kh zmanh jahlyt myn kya hwa tha۔"
"3319","jabr by۔ atyq nay khda kay pyghmbr ka byan krtay hwyay kha: ’’hsd hay jsay khda psnd krta hay awr hsd hay js say khda nfrt krta hay۔ js chyz kw wh psnd krta hay wh shk kay maamlay myn hsd hay awr js chyz say wh napsndydh hay wh as chyz pr hsd hay js myn shk nhyn hay۔ ghrwr hay js say khda nfrt krta hay awr ghrwr hay jsay khda psnd krta hay۔ wh js say mhbt krta hay wh lrtay hwyay awr sdqh dytay wqt aadmy ka ghrwr hay awr js chyz say khda nfrt krta hay wh tkbr say zahr hwta hay۔ ayk wrzhn myn \zlm say\"" hwta hay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3320","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say kha kh an kay dada nay ayk aadmy kay baray myn btaya jw ath kr khta hay kh allh kay rswl، flan flan myra byta hay، myn nay zmanh jahlyt myn as ky man say najayz hmbstry ky thy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya، \aslam myn wldyt ka kwyy najayz dawyٰ nhyn hay، jw kchh zmanh jahlyt myn kya jata tha، wh mnswkh kr dya jata hay، bchh js kay bstr pr pyda hwta hay as ky trf mnswb kya jata hay، awr zany ksy hq say mhrwm hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3321","anhwn nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \char qsm ky awrtyn hyn jn pr kwyy lant nhyn hw skty:* ayk aysayy awrt js ka ksy mslman say nkah hwta hay، ayk yhwdy ka ksy mslman say nkah hwta hay، ayk aazad awrt ka ghlam say nkah hwta hay، awr ayk lwndy ka ksy aazad say nkah hwta hay۔ *yh lantwn ky bahmy dawt hay js say yh bab talq rkhta hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3322","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk mrd awr bywy kw ayk dwsray pr bddaa krnay ka hkm dya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw hkm dya kh jb wh panchwyn klmh pr aayay tw apnay mnh pr hath rkhay، yh khtay hwyay kh yh fyslh krnay wala hay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3323","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm rat kw an kay pas say nklay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm pr rshk krtay thay۔ phr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm aayay awr dykha kh wh kya kr rhy hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aayshh tmhyn kya hwa hay، kya tm hsd krty hw؟ as nay jwab dya، \mjh jysa aadmy aap jysay shkhs pr kywn hsd nh kray؟\"" as nay kha tmhara shytan tmharay pas aaya hay۔ as nay pwchha، \""khda kay rswl، kya myn shytan hwn؟\"" as nay asay btaya kh as kay pas hay، awr jb as nay as say pwchha kh kya as kay pas hay tw as nay jwab dya، \""han، lykn khda nay as kay khlaf myry mdd ky hay takh myn mhfwz rhwn۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3324","abw slmh kw fatmh bnt qys nay btaya kh abw amrw bnt hfs nay asay balkl tlaq day dy jb wh ghr say dwr tha، awr as kay ayjnt nay asay kchh jw bhyja۔ wh as say naraz hwyy awr jb as nay kha kh myn khda ky qsm kha kr khty hwn kh aap ka hm pr kwyy dawyٰ nhyn hay tw wh rswl allhﷺ kay pas gyy awr aapﷺ say as ka zkr kya۔ yh khtay hwyay kh as kay pas kwyy nfqh nhyn hay، aap nay asay am shryk kay ghr dwbarh nkah krnay say phlay adt gzarnay ka hkm dya، lykn bad myn frmaya: \yh wh awrt hay js say myray ashab mltay hyn، abn am mktwm kay ghr myn adt gzarw، kywnkh wh nabyna hay awr tm kpray atar sktay hw، phr jb tm dwbarh nkah krnay ky pwzyshn myn hw tw mjhay btao۔\"" as nay kha kh jb wh dwbarh shady krnay ky pwzyshn myn thy tw as nay an say kha kh maawyh bn. abw sfyan awr abw jhm nay an say nkah ka mtalbh kya tha tw as nay jwab dya kh abwjhm ka talq tw wh apnay kndhay say lathy nhyn atarta awr jhan tk maawyh ka talq hay tw wh ghryb aadmy hay js kay pas kwyy jayydad nhyn، asamh bn zyd say shady kr lw۔ as nay as pr aatraz kya، lykn as nay kha، \""asamh say shady kr lw،\"" tw as nay as say shady ky، khda nay as ky bhlayy ky، awr wh rshk krnay lgy۔ as kay akhtyar pr ayk nskhh hay، \""jhan tk abw jhm ka talq hay، wh ayk aysa aadmy hay jsay awrtwn kw marnay kay lyay dya jata hay۔\"" ayk rwayt myn hay kh as kay shwhr nay asay tyn bar tlaq dy awr jb wh nby kay pas gyy tw aap nay frmaya kh jb tk tm hamlh nh hw tm pr kwyy nfqh wajb nhyn hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3325","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha kh fatmh ayk tnhayy myn thyn awr jhan wh thyn as kay baray myn khwf tary tha، as lyay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn htanay ky ajazt dy۔ ayk nskhh myn as nay pwchha kh fatmh kay sath kya maamlh hay awr kya wh khda say nhyn drty، yany as kay hwalay say yh kha kh as kay pas rhnay ky jgh nhyn hay awr nh hy kwyy kfalt hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3326","sayd by۔ almsyb nay kha kh fatmh kw mhz as lyay htaya gya kh an kay pas apnay shwhr kay rshth darwn kay khlaf bht kchh khna tha۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3327","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myry khalh kw tyn tlaqwn say tlaq hw gyy awr wh apny khjwrwn kay phl katna chahty thyn، lykn ayk shkhs nay anhyn bahr janay say mna kya، tw wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyyn awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”zrwr apny khjwr kay phl kat dw، shayd kh tm sdqh krw ya kwyy nyk aml krw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3328","almswar b۔ mkhrmh nay kha kh an kay shwhr ky wfat kay kchh rat bad sbah aslmyh nay ayk bchay kw jnm dya۔ phr wh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyy awr nkah ky ajazt tlb ky۔ as nay asay ajazt day dy awr as nay shady kr ly۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3329","am slmh rzy allh anha say mrwy hay kh ayk awrt nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayy awr arz kya: ya rswl allh، myry byty ka shwhr fwt hw gya hay awr as ky aankh pryshan hay، tw kya hm as pr kalyrym lga sktay hyn؟ as nay dw ya tyn bar \nhyn\"" kha، hr wqt srf \""nhyn\"" kha۔ as kay bad frmaya: ’’srf char mhynay awr ds dn hwyay hyn، jb kh zmanh jahlyt myn tm myn say ksy nay gwbr ka tkra nhyn phynka yhan tk kh ayk sal gzr gya۔ sy ayf lyn، lght awr taj alarws؛ mrqat، 3:513 ch۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3330","am hbybh awr zynb bnt jhsh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy awrt kay lyay jw allh awr aakhry dn pr ayman rkhty hw، jayz nhyn kh wh tyn ratwn say zyadh mrnay walay pr swg mnayay، swayay shwhr kay char mhynay ds dn kay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3331","kya am atyh nay khda kw khbr dy؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \awrt shwhr kay maamlay myn char mhynay awr ds dn kay alawh tyn ratwn say zyadh swg nh kray، awr nh hy rngay hwyay kpray phnay، swayay rngay hwyay dhagay kay، 1 ya kalyrym lgayay، ya atr kw chhwyay، swayay as kay kh thwry sy kwsts ya azfr2 kay alawh jb wh pak hw jayay۔\"" 1. Asb. yh lfz ymny lbas ky ayk qsm pr lagw hwta hay jw kpray say bna hwta tha jsay bnay say phlay rng dya jata tha۔ 2. anglywn kay nakhn say mshabh ayk mkhsws bdbwdar madh jw bkhwr myn astamal hwta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm) abwdaod nay mzyd kha: ya mhndy lgao۔"""""
"3332","zynb bnt kab nay kha kh alfryah bnt malk bnt۔ snan awr abw sayd khdry ky bhn nay anhyn btaya kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyyn awr by khdrh kay drmyan apny qwm kay pas waps janay ky ajazt mangy، kywnkh an ka shwhr apnay kchh ghlamwn ky tlash myn nkla tha jw bhag gyay thay awr anhwn nay asay qtl kr dya tha۔ as nay kha kh as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say drkhwast ky kh wh apny qwm kay pas waps chlay jayyn، kywnkh as kay shwhr nay asay apnay ghr myn nhyn chhwra tha awr nh hy as nay kwyy nghdasht chhwry thy awr jb wh razy hwyy tw wh chly gyyn، lykn jb wh shn myn (ya msjd myn) thyn tw aap nay asay blaya awr kha kh mqrrh mdt khtm hwnay tk apnay ghr myn rhw۔ as nay btaya kh as nay char mah ds dn as dwranyh ka mshahdh kya۔ malk، trmzy، abwdaod، nsayy، asay abn majh awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3333","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh jb abw slmh rzy allh anh ka antqal hw gya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mjh say mlnay tshryf layay awr myn nay apnay awpr msbbr ka jws playa tha۔ as nay mjh say pwchha kh yh kya hay tw myn nay asay btaya kh yh srf aylws ka rs hay awr as myn kwyy atr nhyn hay، tw as nay kha kh as say chhray ky rwnq hwty hay، as lyay asay srf rat kw lgayyn awr dn myn atar dyn، awr khwshbw ya mhndy say knghy nh kryn، kywnkh yh rng hay۔ myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh knghy krtay wqt mjhay kya astamal krna chahyay، tw aap nay mjhay kha kh lwtay kay drkht kay ptwn ka astamal krw awr an say apnay sr kw achhy trh msh krw۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3334","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js ka shwhr fwt hw jayay wh zafran ya srkh mty say rngay hwyay kpray ya zywrat nh phnay awr nh hy mhndy lgwayay، asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3335","slyman by ysar nay byan kya kh ahwas sham myn as wqt fwt hwa jb as ky bywy jsay as nay tlaq dy thy tysry mahwary kay shrwa myn thy، jysa kh maawyh bn۔ abw sfyan nay zyd kw lkha۔ sabt as say as baray myn pwchh rha hay۔ zyd nay jwab myn lkha kh jb as ky tysry hyz shrwa hwyy tw wh as say aazad thy awr wh as say aazad tha۔ wh as ky trf say ya wh as say wrast myn nhyn aaskta tha۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3336","sayd by۔ almsyb nay amr bn khtab say rwayt ky hay۔ alkhtab khtay hyn: \agr kwyy awrt tlaq yafth hw awr asay ayk ya dw hyz aayay tw hyz aana bnd hw jayay tw asay nw mhynay antzar krna chahyay، awr agr zahr hw kh wh hamlh hay tw as kay mtalq ahkam lagw hyn، wrnh nw mhynay kay khtm hwnay kay bad asay tyn mah ky mdt pwry krny chahyay، as kay bad wh dwbarh nkah kr skty hay۔\"" malk nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3337","abw aldrdaa rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk awrt kay pas say gzray jw bchay ky pydaysh kay qryb thy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn pwchha tw btaya gya kh yh flan ky lwndy hay۔ as nay pwchha kh kya wh as say hmbstry kr rha hay awr jb asay btaya gya kh wh hay tw as nay kha kh myn as pr lant bhyjwn ga jw as kay sath as ky qbr myn dakhl hw jayay ga، jb wh as kay lyay hlal nhyn hay tw wh bchay kw as ky khdmt myn kysay lay jayay ga ya jb as kay lyay hlal nhyn hay tw as ka wars kysay bna skta hay؟ pth nhyn bchh as ka tha ya nhyn۔ agr wh bchay kay sath ghlam ky trh slwk krta hay tw wh apnay bytay kw ghlam bna rha hay، awr agr wh asay wars smjhta hay tw wh as kay sath aysa kr rha hay jw as ka byta nhyn tha۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3338","abw sayd alkhrdy nay awtas myn qydywn kay baray myn nby sly allh alyh wslm ka yh qwl nql kya hay: \hamlh awrt say as wqt tk hmbstry nhyn krny chahyay jb tk kh wh apnay bchay kw jnm nh day، ya hamlh nh hw jb tk kh asay ayk mahwary nh hw۔\"" ahmd، abwdaod awr darmy nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3339","rwafz b۔ thbyt۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ywm hnyn kay mwqa pr frmaya: jw shkhs allh awr aakhrt kay dn pr ayman rkhta hw asay ksy dwsray nay apnay pany say pany playa (yany hamlh awrtwn say hmbstry krna) hlal nhyn، as mrd kay lyay hlal nhyn jw allh awr aakhry dn pr ayman rkhta hw awr asyr awrt say as wqt tk hmbstry kray jb tk kh as kw hyz nh aayay awr wh mrd kay lyay hlal nh hw۔ ghnymt bychna yhan tk kh tqsym hw jayay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay awr trmzy nay asay \jw dwsray nay apnay pany say bwya hay\"" tk phnchaya hay۔"""""
"3340","malk rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay sna hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm yh hkm dytay thay kh lwndywn say as wqt tk jmaa nh kya jayay jb tk kh an kw hyz nh aayay، agr wh hyz waly tadad myn say hwn ya nh aanay walwn ky swrt myn tyn mhynay gzr jayyn، awr ksy dwsray kw pany planay say mna frmaya۔ Razin mntql."
"3341","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh jb kwyy lrky js say hmbstry hw skty thy asay thfh day dya jayay ya bych dya jayay ya aazad kr dya jayay tw asay hyz aanay tk antzar krna zrwry hay، lykn knwary ky swrt myn yh ghyr zrwry hay۔ Razin mntql."
"3342","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh atbh ky byty hnd nay kha: allh kay rswl، abw sfyan ayk bkhyl aadmy hay jw mjhay awr myray bytay kw kafy nhyn dyta، swayay as kay jw myn as kay alm kay bghyr as say lyty hwn۔ as nay jwab dya، ’’tmharay awr tmharay bytay kay lyay jw kafy hay asay lay lw js hd tk shryat nay tslym kya hay۔ rqm lwgwn kay halat kay mtabq mkhtlf hwgy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3343","jabr by۔ smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh tm myn say ksy kw flah day tw asay chahyay kh wh sb say phlay apnay awpr awr apnay ghr walwn pr khrch kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3344","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghlam as kay khanay awr lbas ka hqdar hay، awr asay as pr why kam mslt krna chahyay jw as ky asttaat hw۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3345","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay tmharay bhayywn kw tmharay matht kr dya hay، lhza jw apnay bhayy kw allh ky trf say as kay matht kray asay chahyay kh wh jw khata hay asay khlayay، jw phnta hay asay phnayay، awr as pr wh kam nh dalay jw as kay lyay bht zyadh hw، lykn agr wh aysa kray tw as ky mdd kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3346","abdallh by۔ amrw nay byan kya kh as kay pas an ka ayk mlazm aaya awr as nay as say pwchha kh kya aap nay ghlamwn kw an ka khana khlaya hay؟ jb as nay jwab dya kh as kay pas nhyn hay tw as nay as say kha kh jao awr anhyn day dw، kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya tha: \ansan kay lyay atna bra qswr hay kh wh apna khana js kay pas hay as say rwk lay۔\"" ayk wrzhn myn hay، \""ayk aadmy kay lyay yh ayk sngyn ghlty hay kh wh asay tbah kr day jsay wh brqrar rkhnay ka pabnd hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3347","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy ka bndh grmy awr dhwyyn kay qryb hwnay kay bad khana tyar kr kay as kay pas layay tw asay chahyay kh asay apnay pas btha kr khayay، lykn agr jmaat zyadh hw awr khana km hw tw asay chahyay kh as myn say ayk ya dw mnh apnay hath myn lay lay۔ *mshfwhan qlylan۔ lfz mshfwhan ka atlaq ya tw as khanay pr hwta hay jw km mqdar myn hw ya as khanay pr jw bht say lwg khatay hwn۔ mokhr alzkr many wazh twr pr yhan lagw hwta hay kywnkh as kay bad qlyl (mqdar myn km) aata hay۔ lykn kchh lwg yhan mshfw kw 'km mqdar myn' smjhtay hyn awr as kay bad qlyl asy many kw zahr krtay hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3348","abdallh by۔ sydna amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ghlam apnay aaqa kay sath khlws say kam lay awr achhy trh allh ky abadt kray tw as kay lyay dwhra ajr hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3349","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh kya hy achha hay kh bnday kw allh ky trf say mwt kay ghat atar dya jayay jb kh wh apnay rb ky achhy trh abadt kray awr apnay malk ky ataat kray، yh as kay lyay ktna achha hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3350","jryr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb bndh bhag jata hay tw as ky daa qbwl nhyn hwty“۔ apnay akhtyar kay ayk wrzhn myn as nay kha، \agr kwyy ghlam bhag jayay tw as pr thfz ka atlaq nhyn hwta۔\"" apnay akhtyar kay ayk awr nskhay myn aap nay frmaya: ’’agr kwyy ghlam apnay aaqaon say bhagta hay tw wh kafr hw jata hay jb tk kh wh an kay pas waps nh aajayay‘‘۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3351","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay abwalqasm rzy allh anh kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw kwyy apnay ghlam kw galy day jb kh wh as kay khnay say bay gnah hw، tw asay qyamt kay dn mara jayay ga، ala yh kh jysa as nay kha hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3352","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”js nay ksy bnday kw ksy aysay jrm pr mara jw as nay nh kya hw ya thpr mara hw tw as ka kfarh asay aazad kr dyna hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3353","abw msawd ansary rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb myn apnay ayk khadm kw mar rha tha tw myn nay apnay pychhay ayk aawaz sny kh aay abw msawd jan lw kh allh tm pr as say zyadh taqt rkhta hay jtna tm as pr rkhtay hw۔ jb mr kr dykha kh yh allh kay rswl hyn tw myn nay kha، \khda kay rswl، wh khda kay lyay aazad hay۔\"" as nay jwab dya، \""agr tm aysa nh krtay tw aag tmhyn jla dyty،\"" ya، \""aag tmhyn chhw lyty۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3354","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say kha kh an kay dada nay ayk shkhs kay baray myn btaya kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha kh myray pas jayydad hay awr myray wald kw myry jayydad ky zrwrt hay۔ aap nay frmaya: tm awr tmhara mal tmharay bap ka hay، tmhary awlad bhtryn chyzwn myn say hay jw tm hasl krtay hw، tmhary awlad jw kchh hasl kray asay khao۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3355","apnay wald kay baray myn anhwn nay kha kh an kay dada nay ayk aadmy kay baray myn btaya kh wh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr khnay lga kh myn ghryb hwn awr myray pas kwyy mal nhyn hay awr myray pas ayk ytym hay js ky prwrsh krna hay۔ aap nay frmaya: apnay ytym kay mal myn say khao، bshrtykh tm asraf nh krw، ya zrwrt say phlay kchh lay lw، ya as myn say kchh zkhyrh kr lw۔ asay abwdaod، nsayy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3356","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apny bymary myn frma rhay thay kh nmaz ky pabndy krw awr apnay ghlamwn ka khyal rkhw۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3357","ahmd awr abwdaod nay aly rzy allh anh say aysa hy nql kya hay۔"
"3358","hzrt abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw apnay mathtwn say bra slwk kray ga wh jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3359","rfya by۔ mkyt say rwayt hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \ksy kay matht lwgwn kay sath achha slwk krnay say khwshhaly aaty hay، lykn bd ftrt bd qsmty kw jnm dyty hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay، lykn myn nay srf almsabyh myn yh azafy alfaz dykhay hyn، \""sdqh bry qsm ky mwt say bchata hay awr ahsan amr kw draz krta hay۔\"""""""
"3360","abw sayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy apnay bnday kw maray awr wh allh ka zkr kray tw tm asay marna chhwr dw“۔ trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn asay nql kya hay، lykn mokhr alzkr nay kha hay kh \asay marna chhwr dw\"" kay bjayay \""asay rwkna chahyay\""۔"""""
"3361","abw aywb rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw shkhs man kw as kay bchay say jda kray ga، allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn as kay dwstwn say jda kr day ga۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3362","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: mjhay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay dw nwjwan pysh kyay jw aaps myn bhayy thay، jb myn nay an myn say ayk kw bych dya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say pwchha: tmharay nwjwan aly kw kya hwa hay؟ jb myn nay asay btaya tw as nay kha، \asay waps lao، asay waps krw۔\"" asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3363","as nay kha kh as nay ayk lwndy kw as kay bchay say alg kr dya، lykn jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay aysa krnay say mna kya tw as nay swda mnswkh kr dya۔ abwdaod nay asay snd myn wqfay kay sath nql kya hay۔"
"3364","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js myn tyn khsltyn hwn gy allh taalyٰ asay aasan mwt day ga awr asay apny jnt myn dakhl kray ga: kmzwrwn kay sath nrmy، waldyn kay sath shfqt awr ghlamwn kay sath hsn slwk“۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3365","abw amamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aly rzy allh anh kw jwany dy awr frmaya kh asay nh marw، kywnkh mjhay nmaz prhnay walwn kw marnay say mna kya gya hay awr myn nay anhyn nmaz prhtay hwyay dykha hay۔ almsabyh myn yh alfaz hyn۔"
"3366","almjtbyٰ myn az darqtny amr bn alkhtab khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn nmaz prhnay walwn kw marnay say mna frmaya hay۔"
"3367","abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr arz kya kh ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myn ksy bnday kw ktny bar maaf krwn؟ as nay kwyy jwab nh dya tw as shkhs nay why kha jw as nay kha tha lykn wh phr bhy khamwsh rha۔ as nay tysry bar pwchha tw as nay jwab dya، \asay (fal jma myn hay) rwzanh str bar maaf krdw۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3368","trmzy nay asay abdallh bn abas say rwayt kya hay۔ amrw"
"3369","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay ghlamwn myn say jw tmhyn khwsh krtay hyn asy say khlao jw tm khatay hw awr anhyn why phnao jw tm khwd phntay hw، lykn an kw bychw jw tm kw psnd nhyn krtay awr allh ky mkhlwq kw azab nhyn dytay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3370","shl b۔ hnzlyh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk khsth hal awnt pr tshryf layay awr frmaya: ”an gwngay janwrwn kay baray myn khda say drw، jb wh achhy halt myn hwn tw an pr swar hw jao awr jb wh achhy halt myn hwn tw anhyn aazad kr dw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3371","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha: jb allh taalyٰ ka yh frman nazl hwa kh ytym kay mal kay qryb nh jana swayay as ky aslah kay lyay۔‘‘ (alqraan 6:152) awr ’’wh lwg jw ytymwn ka mal nahq khatay hyn‘‘۔ (alqraan 4:10) jw lwg ksy ytym kay zmh dar thay wh gyay awr apna khana pyna as say alg kr lya awr agr ytym kay khanay pynay myn say kchh bcha hwa tha tw wh as kay lyay as wqt tk rkh dytay thay jb tk kh wh asay nh kha lay ya wh khrab hw jayay۔ yh bwjh pa kr anhwn nay as maamlay ka zkr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kya awr allh taalyٰ nay arshad frmaya: ’’awr wh tm say ytymwn kay baray myn pwchhtay hyn، khh dw kh an kay lyay thyk krna achha hay، awr agr tm an kay sath mlap krw gay tw wh tmharay bhayy hyn‘‘ (alqraan 2:220)۔ as kay bad anhwn nay apnay khanay pynay kw apnay sath mlaya۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3372","abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an lwgwn pr lant frmayy js nay man bap kw apnay bchay say awr bhayy kw bhayy say jda kya۔ asay abn majh awr darqtny nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3373","abdallh by۔ msawd nay kha kh jb asyrwn kw nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an kw alg krnay ky napsndydgy kay zryaay khandanwn kw aktha kya۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3374","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn btata hwn kh tmharay bdkar kwn hyn، yh wh hyn jw akylay khatay hyn، apnay ghlamwn kw martay hyn awr an ky mdd say rwktay hyn“۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3375","hzrt abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw apnay mathtwn say bra slwk kray ga wh jnt myn nhyn jayay ga۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya kh kya aap nay anhyn yh nhyn btaya tha kh as qwm myn ksy bhy dwsray say zyadh ghlam awr ytym hyn، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh han، tw an kay sath bhy asy trh skhawt krw jysa kh tm apnay bchwn kay sath krtay hw awr jw kchh khatay hw as myn say anhyn khana khlatay hw۔ phr anhwn nay pwchha kh anhyn dnya say kya faydh hwa tw as nay jwab dya kh ayk ghwra jsay tm khda ky rah myn lrnay kay lyay lys krtay hw awr ayk ghlam jw tmhary kafy khdmt krta hay awr jb wh nmaz prhta hay tw wh tmhara bhayy hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3376","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh mjhay ahd kay sal rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya jb myn chwdh sal ka tha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay waps bhyj dya۔ phr mjhay khndq kay sal as kay samnay laya gya jb myn pndrh sal ka tha tw as nay mjhay lrnay ky ajazt day dy۔ abdalazyz nay kha kh yh lrnay walay mrdwn awr bchwn kay drmyan frq kw zahr krta hay۔ *aazany۔ as ka trjmh awpr kya ja skta hay ya as ka mtlb hw skta hay \as nay mjhay ayk lrnay walay aadmy ky ajazt dy\""۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3377","albraa b۔ aazb khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hdybyh kay mwqa pr tyn shrtwn pr slh ky: agr mshrkwn myn say kwyy an kay pas aayay tw anhyn an kay pas waps bhyj day۔ kh agr mslmanwn myn say kwyy an kay pas jayay tw wh asay waps nh bhyjyn۔ awr asay aglay sal mkh myn dakhl hwnay ky ajazt dy jayay awr as myn tyn dn qyam kya jayay۔ jb wh as myn dakhl hwa awr adt gzr gyy tw wh bahr chla gya، awr hmzh ky byty as kay pychhay chly awr pkarty hwyy، ’’chcha، chcha‘‘۔ aly nay as ka hath pkra awr aly، zyd awr jafr nay as kay baray myn jhgra kya۔ aly nay kha kh myn nay asay lay lya hay awr wh myray chcha ky byty hay۔ jafr nay kha kh wh myray chcha ky byty hay awr as ky khalh myry bywy hyn۔ zyd nay kha wh myray bhayy ky byty hay۔ as kay bad nby sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay baray myn as ky khalh kay hq myn fyslh dya awr frmaya kh khalh man kay mrtbay pr hyn۔ as nay aly say kha: tm mjh say talq rkhtay hw awr myn tm say talq rkhta hwn۔ jafr say kha tm myry shkl w swrt say mshabh hw۔ awr zyd say kha kh tm hmaray bhayy awr mokl hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3378","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hkm pr apnay dada abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kw kha۔ amrw nay ayk awrt kay baray myn byan kya js nay kha kh allh kay rswl، myra rhm myray as bytay kay lyay brtn tha، myry chhatyan as kay lyay pany ky khal awr myry gwd as kay lyay mhafz thy، as kay bawjwd as kay bap nay mjhay tlaq day dy hay awr wh asay mjh say dwr krna chahta hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm as pr zyadh hqdar hw jb tk kh tm shady nh krw۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3379","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk lrkay kw as kay wald awr as ky man myn say ayk ka antkhab dya۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3380","as nay ayk awrt kay baray myn btaya jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayy awr khnay lgy kh myra shwhr myray bytay kw lay jana chahta hay awr as nay myray lyay pynay awr dygr fwayd frahm kyay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh tmhara bap hay awr yh tmhary man hay، an myn say js ka chahw hath pkr lw۔ as nay apny man ka hath pkra awr wh as kay sath chly gyy۔ abwdaod، nsayy awr darmy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3381","hlal by۔ asamh nay ahl mdynh kay mokl abw mymwnh slyman* ka hwalh dytay hwyay kha: myn abwhryrh kay pas bytha hwa tha kh ayk farsy awrt apnay ayk bytay kay sath an kay pas aayy۔ asay as kay shwhr nay tlaq dy thy awr dwnwn nay as pr dawyٰ kya tha۔ as nay asay ajnby tqryr myn mkhatb krtay hwyay btaya kh as ka shwhr as kay bytay kw lay jana chahta hay، awr abwhryrh nay an say kha kh as kay lyay qrah dalyn، awr yh bat an say ghyr mlky tqryr myn khy۔ phr as kay shwhr nay aakr pwchha kh as say an kay bytay kay baray myn kwn jhgra kr rha hay tw abwhryrh nay khda kay nam pr asay yqyn dlaya kh as nay jw kchh kha hay as ky wjh srf yh hay kh ayk dfah jb wh rswl allh ﷺ kay pas bythay hwyay thay tw ayk awrt an kay pas aayy awr khnay lgy kh aay khda kay rswl myra shwhr myra byta athana chahta hay awr as nay mjhay faydh phnchaya awr abw anbh kay knwyn say myray lyay pany nkala۔ (nsayy kay pas mythay pany say hay۔) rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as kay lyay qrah dalw۔ as kay shwhr nay pwchha kh myray bytay kay baray myn mjh say kwn jhgra kr rha hay؟ awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh tmhara bap hay awr yh tmhary man hay، lhza an myn say js ka chahw hath pkr lw“ awr as nay apny man ka hath pkr lya۔ mrqat s 536 myn kha gya hay kh mshkw ky tmam nsws myn slyman zahr hwta hay lykn shyh swrt slman hay۔ abwdaod، tlaq، 35 (2 jld، qahrh، 1348 hjry myn) myn slmh (ya slmh) hay۔ mzyd dykhyn abn hjrthzybs 253۔ abwdaod awr nsayy nay asay nql kya hay، lykn nsayy nay as nskhh ka zkr kya hay jw nby sly allh alyh wslm say mnqwl hay۔ darmy nay asay hlal by ky snd say nql kya hay۔ asamh۔"
"3382","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay ksy mslman ghlam kw aazad kya tw allh taalyٰ as kay jsm kay hr azw kay bdlay ayk azw kw jhnm say aazad kr day ga، htyٰ kh as ky shrmgah kw bhy۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3383","abwzr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh kwn sa aml sb say afzl hay، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh pr ayman awr as ky rah myn jhad۔ phr pwchha kh kwn say bnday sb say achhay hyn 1 tw as nay jwab dya۔ \wh lwg jn ky qymt sb say zyadh hay awr jnhyn an kay lwg sb say zyadh azt dytay hyn۔\"" as nay pwchha kh agr as kay mtabq kam krnay say qasr hw tw asay kya krna chahyay awr as nay jwab dya، \""aap kw ksy mzdwr ky mdd krny chahyay، ya ksy ghyr hnr mnd kay lyay kam krna chahyay۔\"" as nay pwchha kh agr as kay mtabq aml krnay say qasr hw tw asay kya krna chahyay tw as nay jwab dya، \""dwsrwn kw kwyy nqsan nh phnchao 3 kywnkh yh sdqh hay jw aap apnay aap kw dytay hyn۔\"" bkhary w mslm۔ 1. yany an kw aazad krnay kay mqsd say۔ 2. arby myn fa an lam afal hay jw kchh mbhm hay۔ as ka ghalbaً mtlb yh hay kh wh yh pwchh rha hay kh agr as mayar kay ghlam kw aazad nh kr skay tw asay kya krna chahyay۔ 3. yh arby tdawnَ alnas mn ashar ka ayk tslym shdh many hay۔ dwsra mmknh many yh hay kh lwgwn kw an ky brayy ky wjh say tnha chhwr dya jayay۔"""""
"3384","albraa b۔ aazb rzy allh anh nay ayk shrayy arb ka byan kya jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha kh mjhay kwyy aysa aml skha dyn jw mjhay jnt myn lay jayay۔ as nay jwab dya kh tm nay thwray alfaz myn bra swal kya hay، ayk aadmy kw aazad krw awr ayk ghlam kw aazad krw۔ as nay pwchha kh kya yh dwnwn ayk jysy nhyn hyn tw as nay jwab dya kh nhyn، aadmy kw aazad krna khwd krna hay awr ghlam kw aazad krna as ky qymt myn hsh hay، aap awntny kw dwdh planay kay lyay bhy qrz dyn js myn zyadh dwdh hw awr jw ghlt kam kray as kay sath hsn slwk krw، agr aysa nhyn kr sktay tw bhwkay kw khana khlao، rybywn kay lyay jw chyz tjwyz ky jayay asay plao awr agr aap aysa nhyn kr sktay tw apny zban kw hr chyz say rwkyn mgr kya achha hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3385","amrw by۔ hzrt abas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy msjd bnayay kh as myn allh ka zkr hw، as kay lyay jnt myn ayk ghr bnaya jayay ga، js nay ksy mslman kw aazad kya tw yh as kay lyay jhnm ka fdyh hay، awr js nay rah khda myn ayk bal sfyd krayay tw yh qyamt kay dn as kay lyay nwr hw ga۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3386","l-ghryf b۔ ayash aldylmy 1 nay kha: hm wsylh bn kay pas gyay۔ asqa awr kha kh kwyy aysy rwayt byan krw js myn kwyy azafh ya chhwt nh hw۔ as nay ghsay say jwab dya kh tm myn say kwyy as wqt tlawt krta hay jb as kay ghr myn qraan ka nskhh ltkaya jata hay awr wh as myn azafh awr kmy krta hay۔ hm nay aalan kya kh hmary mrad srf wh rwayt hay jw anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm say sny thy، awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay kha kh wh apnay ayk dwst kay baray myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay hyn jw qtl kay lyay (yany jhnm) ka msthq hay، 2 awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm ghlam kw as ky trf say aazad krw gay tw allh as kay jsm kay hr azw kay bdlay ayk azw kw jhnm say aazad kr day ga۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔ 1. mrqat، iii، 540 alghrf aldylmy dyta hay lykn khta hay kh asay shyh twr pr abn aldylmy hwna chahyay۔ as myn mzyd kha gya hay kh hkym nay apny mstdrk myn kha hay kh alghryf abdallh bn msawd ka lqb tha۔ aldylmy، awr yh kh jama alslw myn as ka nam alghrf b dya gya hay۔ ayash aldylamy۔ dmshq aydn myn yh shkl hay۔ mshkat ka، jw awpr trjmh myn astamal hwa hay۔ asay abn hjr، thzyb، VI، 245 nay bhy dya hay۔"
"3387","smwra by۔ jndb rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bhtryn sdqh shfaat hay js kay lyay ghlam aazad kya jata hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3388","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ghlam myn apna hsh aazad kray awr as kay pas atny rqm hw kh as ky pwry qymt ada kr skay، tw as ghlam ky mnasb qymt mqrr ky jayay، as kay shrykwn kw an ka hsh dya jayay، awr as trh ghlam kw aazad kr dya jayay، wrnh wh phlay aadmy kay hsay ky hd tk aazad hw ga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3389","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ghlam myn say hsh aazad kray، agr as kay pas mal hw tw asay mkml twr pr aazad kr dya jayay ga، lykn agr as kay pas kchh nh hw tw ghlam kw as ky aazady ky adayygy kay lyay kam krna hwga، lykn as pr zyadh bwjh nhyn hwna chahyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3390","amran by۔ hsyn nay kha kh ayk shkhs js kay pas kwyy awr mal nhyn tha as nay mwt kay wqt apnay chh ghlamwn kw aazad kr dya۔ khda kay rswl nay anhyn blaya، awr anhyn tyn hswn myn tqsym krnay kay bad، an myn qrah dalnay، dw kw aazad krnay awr char kw ghlam rkhnay kay bad، aap nay as kay baray myn skht bat ky۔ nsayy nay asay amran ky snd say nql kya hay، lykn \as nay as pr skht bat ky hay\"" ky jgh as nay zkr kya hay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""myn as pr nmaz nh prhna chahta tha۔\"" abwdaod ky rwayt myn anhwn nay kha kh agr myn an ky tdfyn say phlay mwjwd hwta tw anhyn mslmanwn kay qbrstan myn dfn nh kya jata۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ *aswl yh hay kh mrnay walay ky jayydad ka km az km dw thayy hsh wrsaa kw jana chahyay۔"""""
"3391","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”byta apnay bap ka qrz ada nhyn krta jb tk kh asay khryd nh lay awr agr asay ghlamy myn payay tw asay aazad nh kr day۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3392","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ansar myn say ayk aadmy nay aalan kya kh as kay mrnay kay bad ayk ghlam aazad hw jayay ga، lykn as kay pas kwyy awr mal nhyn tha، jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh sna tw frmaya: kwn asay mjh say khryday ga؟ awr naym b۔ nhm nay asay aath sw drhm myn khryda۔ mslm ka ayk nskhh khta hay kh naym by۔ abdallh aladwy nay asay aath sw drhm myn khryda jsay wh nby krym ﷺ kay pas lay kr aayay tw aap ﷺ nay anhyn as shkhs kay hwalay krtay hwyay frmaya: ’’phlay apnay awpr sdqh krw، agr kchh bch jayay tw apnay ghr walwn kw day dw، agr an kay pas kchh bcha hay tw apnay rshth darwn kw day dw، awr agr kchh bch jayay tw as ka mtlb yh hay kh an kay pas tqsym kya jayay‘‘۔ as kay dayyn awr bayyn trf۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3393","amam hsn nay smrh ky snd say byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \agr ksy kay pas ksy aysay rshth dar ka qbzh hw jw mmnwah drjat myn hw tw wh aazad hw jata hay۔\"" asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3394","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy mrd ky lwndy as kay lyay bchh pyda krty hay tw wh as ky mwt pr aazad hw jaty hay۔ * mtn myn 'aao drbwr an mnhw aw bdh' hay jw transmytr ky trf say as shk ky nshandhy krta hay kh kwn say alfaz astamal kyay gyay hyn۔ dwnwn tasrat ayk hy chyz kay mtradf hyn as lyay mzkwrh trjmh myn \an ky mwt pr\"" dyna kafy malwm hwta hay۔"""""
"3395","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr abwbkr rzy allh anh kay zmanay myn hm nay an lwndywn kw bycha jw bchay pyda krty thyn، lykn jb amr rzy allh anh ky hkwmt thy tw anhwn nay hmyn aysa krnay say mna kya awr hm nay rwk dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3396","abn amr rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy aysay ghlam kw aazad kray js kay pas mal hw tw asay ghlam ka mal mlay ga، ala yh kh aaqa as kay alawh kwyy shrt nh lgayay“۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3397","abwalmlyh nay apnay wald ky trf say byan kya kh jb ayk shkhs nay ghlam myn say hsh aazad kya awr as maamlay ka tzkrh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kya gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh allh ka kwyy shryk nhyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3398","sfynh nay kha: myn am slmh rzy allh anha ky ghlam thy، as nay kha kh myn tmhyn aazad kr dwn gy، lykn myn yh shrt rkhty hwn kh jb tk tm zndh rhw gay tm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt krw gay، myn nay jwab dya، \agr tm mjh say kwyy shrt nh bhy rkhw tw myn jb tk zndh rhw gy، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw nhyn chhwrwn gy۔\"" phr as nay mjhay aazad kr dya awr myray sath wsyt ky۔ abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3399","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh as dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \js ghlam nay apny aazady khrydnay ka maahdh kya hay wh as wqt tk ghlam hay jb tk kh tay shdh qymt ka ayk drhm ada krna baqy rhay\""۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3400","am slmh rzy allh anha nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw jaswsy kay twr pr byan kya kh jb tm myn say ksy awrt ky ghlam apny aazady khrydnay ka maahdh kr lay awr wh pwry qymt ada kr skay tw asay as say prdh krna chahyay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3401","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh agr kwyy apnay ghlam kw sw awqyh kay awz apny aazady khrydnay pr razy hw jayay awr wh ds dynar kay swa baqy sb ada kray awr phr wh rqm pwry nh kr skay tw wh ghlam hy rhta hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3402","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy ghlam nay apny aazady khrydnay ka maahdh kya hw tw asay khwn ka mal ya myras ml jayay tw wh as hd tk wrast hasl kr skta hay js hd tk asay aazad kya gya hw“۔ trmzy kay ayk nskhay myn as nay kha kh \khwn aql as ghlam kay lyay ada kya jata hay js nay apny aazady khrydnay ka maahdh kya hw as qymt pr jw ayk aazad kay lyay ada kya hay jhan tk as nay khryd ky rqm ada ky hay، awr ghlam kay lyay ada ky gyy qymt pr jhan tk baqy ka talq hay،\"" lykn anhwn nay asay zayf qrar dya۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3403","abdalrhmn by۔ abw amrh ansary nay byan kya kh an ky waldh nay ayk ghlam kw aazad krnay ka aradh kya tha lykn anhwn nay asay sbh tk mltwy kr dya awr wh fwt hw gyyn۔ abdalrhmn nay kha kh as nay alqasm say pwchha۔ agr mhmd as ky trf say ghlam kw aazad kr day tw kya as say as kw kwyy faydh hw ga، awr alqasm nay asay btaya kh sad bn۔ abadh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya tha kh as ky waldh fwt hw gyy hyn awr pwchha kh kya as ky trf say ghlam aazad kr dyn tw kya faydh hw ga، awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh aysa hw ga۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3404","yhyyٰ by۔ sayd nay byan kya kh abdalrhmn bn۔ abwbkr ky mwt nynd myn hwyy awr an ky bhn aayshh rzy allh anha nay an ky trf say bht say ghlamwn kw aazad kya۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3405","abdallh by۔ sydna amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy ghlam khryday awr as kay mal kay baray myn kwyy shrt nh lgayay tw asay as myn say kchh nhyn mlay ga۔ darymy nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3406","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm ky sb say bry qsm yh thy kh nhyn، as ky qsm jw dlwn kw alt dyta hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3407","as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh aap nay frmaya: \khda tmhyn apnay bap dada ky qsm khanay say mna krta hay، agr kwyy qsm khayay tw asay chahyay kh wh khda ky qsm khayay، wrnh khamwsh rhay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3408","abdalrhmn by۔ smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”btwn ky qsm nh khao awr nh apnay bap dada ky“۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3409","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kwyy aysy qsm khayay js myn wh khay kh lat w azyٰ ky qsm، tw asay chahyay kh allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn“۔ awr yh kh agr kwyy apnay dwst say khay kh \aao mjhay tmharay sath pysay kay lyay khylnay dw\"" tw asay sdqh dyna chahyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3410","sabt b۔ zhak rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs aslam kay alawh ksy awr mzhb ky jhwty qsm khata hay wh aysa hy hay jysa kh as nay kha hay، abn aadm ksy aysy chyz ky qsm nh khayay jw as kay pas nh hw، awr agr kwyy as dnya myn ksy chyz say apnay aap kw qtl kray tw asay qyamt kay dn as ky sza dy jayay gy، agr kwyy ksy pr lant bhyjta hay tw yh as pr ayman lanay walay kay qtl kay brabr hay۔ as kw qtl krna awr agr kwyy bht zyadh hasl krnay ka jhwta dawyٰ kray tw khda asay zyadh kay bjayay km day ga۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) *many kay baray myn aaraa mkhtlf hyn۔ baz khtay hyn kh as ka mtlb hay kh wh jhwta hay، baz khtay hyn kh wh kafr hay۔"
